    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #47 Quantitative Review & Parameter Mutation\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash returned a positive net P&L (\u20b9+19.19, PF: 1.33), reversing the negative baseline, though brokerage and statutory fees (\u20b929.32) consumed a disproportionate share of gross edge. Forensics on the four losing trades revealed mid-morning stop whipsaws at the 0.65% threshold and late-afternoon momentum decay leading to fee-induced EOD square-off losses. To fortify the strategy against NSE midday chop and afternoon theta decay, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.72% to survive normal institutional pullback noise, elevating `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.45x to filter out low-conviction afternoon drifts, tightening `min_target_pct` to 1.25% to capture intraday swings before the 15:15 close, and lowering `breakeven_trigger_r` to 0.90R to aggressively neutralize fee drag on stalling trades."
